// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1780112955" "You've done an excellent job securing the coral key which should lead us to the Temple of the Waters. However, this constant interference by Longbow is becoming troublesome and annoying. We need to find who is spearheading these operations against us and put them out of commission! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Disrupt Longbow investigations into Barracuda!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P4133430747" "Disrupt Longbow Operations"
// SendOffString :
"P1172449492" "Once we put the Longbow agents responsible out of commission, we can carry out our task without further interference!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_3_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P134339120" "Interrogate Longbow on Nerva"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3370414128" "Wring the truth from those Longbow agents! Attack Agincourt in the Nerva Archipelago."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2915507932" "<shout>We know you're up to something, {VillainName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4198974603" "The Longbow agents tell you about Operation Frozen Ocean!"

