"P2228483836" "That should send 'Operation Frozen Ocean' back for awhile!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2846952598" "We have a bit of a problem. Apparently, the coral key was on its way to Ghost Widow, and she was not pleased to find it missing. Your team was identified as the perpetrators of the assault, and she will stop at nothing to punish those responsible.<br><br>Fortunately, one of her Fortunatas may be willing to speak to her on your behalf, but there will be a price. If it'll keep Ghost Widow from enacting vengeance it'll be worth whatever price she asks. <A HREF={ACCEPT}Go to Mercy Island and speak with Kalinda.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P142848518" "Appease Ghost Widow"
// SendOffString :
"P2220614319" "Report back once you have appeased Ghost Widow. You'll get final orders from Barracuda when you return."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_4_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1503278258" "Speak with Kalinda"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3119752739" "What are you waiting for? Do you want Ghost Widow to come after your personally? Believe me, you DON'T want that to happen!"
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2868598206" "<shout>Ghost Widow wants your head on a platter, {VillainName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P405507938" "{VillainName} - I've seen you claw your way up from the mess of Darwin's Landing in an effort to prove yourself as one of Lord Recluse's destined ones. Certain things are forgiven for you, but stealing from one of Lord Recluse's own faction leaders is not one of them, even at the behest of another one. Because you are one of Lord Recluse's chosen I have spoken to Ghost Widow on your behalf. Ghost Widow seeks reparations for your blatant theft. This is non-negotiable: if you seek to use gain access to the mystic portal you will need to before a task for Ghost Widow.<br><br>There is a group known as the Banished Pantheon, a mystical group whose shamans feed upon death and suffering. There is a leader of the Banished Pantheon known as Gharbu who lairs in Paragon City.  He possesses a magical artifact called the death rattle which Ghost Widow believes would be a worthy replacement for the coral key. Retrieve it for her and she will allow you to use Technician Naylor's portal.<br><br>An Arachnos flyer will deliver you to the graveyard in Paragon City. Go now!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_4_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3893336799" "Steal death rattle"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3089803429" "If this is what it takes to appease Ghost Widow, I suggest you do what Kalinda says."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4190932855" "<shout>For theft of Arachnos property, you're sentenced to death!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3128868677" "You depart the Arachnos flyer and head over to the graveyard in Paragon City. Within, you see shambling figures moving about."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P308648305" "Gharbu"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P802832434" "<shout>Gharbu will rip the flesh from your bones!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - DefeatGharbu 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3307159748" "Defeat Gharbu and minions"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2722182335" "You have defeated Gharbu!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4261109366" "You have stolen the death rattle!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_4_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2889104914" "Deliver death rattle to Kalinda"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P520868379" "Deliver the death rattle with all haste! We must have access to that portal!"
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2560587064" "<shout>Don't think you can keep running, scum!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4275841905" "Ah, the death rattle. Ghost Widow's anger will subside now that she has this.<br><br>Go now, and do not cross Ghost Widow again!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P594612146" "So Ghost Widow is appeased? Good. Interference from Longbow is one thing, but direct opposition from another of the faction leaders is quite another. Even Captain Mako is careful not to cross Ghost Widow if he can help it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P731066746" "Looks like everything is set for the raid on the Temple of the Waters. You have secured the coral key, put Longbow in its place, and have gained access to the portal. The power held in the Eye of the Levithan will soon be ours!<br><br>The temple itself is rumored to have powerful guardians. Barracuda has been gathering weapons to use against the guardians, and wants you to arm up before entering the portal. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to the warehouse and retrieve the weapons</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1253792730" "Retrieve weapons"
// SendOffString :
"P3680430114" "Barracuda procured the weapons from Family arms smugglers who are expecting payment. Barracuda wants these loose ends eliminated if you run across any of them."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P952844357" "What are you waiting for? Barracuda is waiting on you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1779705258" "You hear Family inside arguing about getting payment for the goods."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2469680301" "What we waitin' for?"
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2178120784" "Barracuda is supposed to pay up here soon."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3608224606" "That's not Barracuda! Ice 'em!"

