"P348298709" "<f=camera><em=attack t=4>Spread out! We need to take down {TaskForceName}!<em=laugh t=8>The power of the Leviathan will be mine alone!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1926333233" "Tastes like fear!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P28693943" "Think you're pretty tough, eh?"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P593315453" "Nice shot. My turn!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3398559683" "<em=grief>Huh. Not the weaklings I thought you'd be!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3781784346" "This isn't over, {VillainName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P118756318" "<em=victory>Another falls prey to Barracuda!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1023216104" "Marcone Consigliere"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4010711636" "I tells ya, you can't even trust those Arachnos boys to come through on a payment. What's honest crime coming to these days?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2672297274" "<em=attack>Fill 'em full of holes!"

